{"seq":3,"slug":"externalities","title":"大学财政学 — 外部性与矫正性政策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/public-finance-foundations/externalities","wordCount":1792,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学财政学-外部性与矫正性政策\">大学财政学 — 外部性与矫正性政策</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>外部性是指一个经济主体的行为，在没有通过市场价格反映的情况下，影响了其他主体的福利。当工厂排放废气，污染了周边居民的空气，却不必为此支付任何代价，这就是<strong>负外部性</strong>——工厂的私人成本低于真实的社会成本，于是它生产得&quot;太多&quot;。反过来，当你接种疫苗，不仅保护了自己，还降低了周围人被传染的概率，这种好处你无法收费，这就是<strong>正外部性</strong>——疫苗接种量会&quot;太少&quot;。</p>\n<p>外部性的本质，是私人成本（收益）与社会成本（收益）之间出现了缺口。市场价格只反映私人的考量，忽略了对第三方的影响，导致资源配置偏离最优。财政学研究的，正是政府如何用税收、补贴等工具把这个被忽略的外部影响&quot;内部化&quot;，让做决策的人承担其行为的全部社会后果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"私人成本-社会成本与无谓损失\">私人成本、社会成本与无谓损失</h3><p>理解外部性的关键是区分两条成本曲线。以一家排污的化工厂为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>私人边际成本（MPC）</strong>：工厂自己付出的成本（原料、人工、能源）。</li>\n<li><strong>社会边际成本（MSC）</strong>：私人成本 + 对第三方造成的外部成本（居民的健康损失、环境破坏）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>负外部性意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSC &gt; MPC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。工厂按私人成本决策，会生产到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPC =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 需求 的产量；但社会最优产量应在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSC =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 需求 处。两者之差，就是过度生产造成的<strong>无谓损失</strong>（deadweight loss）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>私人视角</th>\n<th>社会视角</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>负外部性（污染）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 偏低</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 更高</td>\n<td>产量过多，需课税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正外部性（疫苗、教育）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 偏低</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 更高</td>\n<td>产量过少，需补贴</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为私人边际收益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为社会边际收益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"庇古税-让污染者付费\">庇古税：让污染者付费</h3><p>英国经济学家阿瑟·庇古（Arthur Pigou）提出了优雅的解决方案：对产生负外部性的行为征税，税额恰好等于外部边际成本。这样，工厂面对的成本就从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 上升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MPC + t = MSC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，它会自动把产量减少到社会最优水平。这种税被称为<strong>庇古税</strong>（Pigouvian tax）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>外部边际成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = MSC - MPC = \\text{外部边际成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">外部边际成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>碳税是当代最著名的庇古税实践。欧盟碳排放交易体系、中国的全国碳市场，本质上都是给&quot;排放二氧化碳&quot;这一负外部性定价，让排放者承担其对气候的社会成本。对正外部性（如疫苗、基础教育），对称的工具是<strong>庇古补贴</strong>——政府补贴接种或上学，把私人收益提升到社会收益水平。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[负外部性: 污染] --&gt; B[私人成本MPC &lt; 社会成本MSC]&#10;    B --&gt; C[市场产量过多]&#10;    C --&gt; D[庇古税 t = MSC - MPC]&#10;    D --&gt; E[产量回到社会最优]&#10;    F[正外部性: 疫苗] --&gt; G[私人收益MPB &lt; 社会收益MSB]&#10;    G --&gt; H[市场产量过少]&#10;    H --&gt; I[庇古补贴]&#10;    I --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[负外部性: 污染] --&gt; B[私人成本MPC &lt; 社会成本MSC]\n    B --&gt; C[市场产量过多]\n    C --&gt; D[庇古税 t = MSC - MPC]\n    D --&gt; E[产量回到社会最优]\n    F[正外部性: 疫苗] --&gt; G[私人收益MPB &lt; 社会收益MSB]\n    G --&gt; H[市场产量过少]\n    H --&gt; I[庇古补贴]\n    I --&gt; E</pre><h3 id=\"科斯定理-产权与市场化解决\">科斯定理：产权与市场化解决</h3><p>并非所有外部性都需要政府征税。经济学家罗纳德·科斯（Ronald Coase）提出了一个革命性观点：<strong>只要产权清晰界定、交易成本足够低，无论产权初始归谁，私人各方都能通过协商达成有效率的结果</strong>——这就是科斯定理。</p>\n<p>举例：上游工厂排污影响下游渔民。如果法律规定&quot;工厂有排污权&quot;，渔民可以付钱请工厂减排；如果规定&quot;渔民有清洁水权&quot;，工厂需付钱给渔民才能排污。两种情况下，只要双方能自由谈判，最终的污染水平都会落到社会最优——产权的初始分配只影响财富分配，不影响效率。</p>\n<p>科斯定理的深刻之处在于揭示：外部性问题的根源往往是<strong>产权不清</strong>或<strong>交易成本过高</strong>，而不仅仅是缺少政府管制。现实中，当涉及成千上万的受害者（如全球气候变化），交易成本极高，科斯式的私人协商失效，这时政府税收或管制就更有效率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"矫正外部性的工具箱\">矫正外部性的工具箱</h3><p>政府矫正外部性有多种工具，各有利弊：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>庇古税/补贴</td>\n<td>价格信号</td>\n<td>给企业灵活减排的激励，效率高</td>\n<td>难以精确测算外部成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量管制（标准）</td>\n<td>直接规定排放上限</td>\n<td>结果确定</td>\n<td>缺乏成本最小化的灵活性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可交易许可证</td>\n<td>总量控制 + 市场交易</td>\n<td>总量确定 + 成本最小化</td>\n<td>初始分配易引发争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明晰产权（科斯）</td>\n<td>私人协商</td>\n<td>无需政府持续干预</td>\n<td>仅适用于交易成本低的小规模情形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国对燃油车征收消费税、对新能源车给予购置补贴，就是庇古税与补贴的组合，意在矫正燃油车的环境负外部性、激励新能源的正外部性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>区分&quot;私人成本&quot;与&quot;社会成本&quot;。为什么负外部性会导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MSC &gt; MPC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，进而造成过度生产？</li>\n<li>一家工厂每生产一吨钢排放的污染给社会造成 200 元损失。按庇古税理论，政府应对每吨钢征收多少税？这笔税如何改变工厂的产量决策？</li>\n<li>用科斯定理分析：上游工厂与下游渔民的污染纠纷，在&quot;工厂有排污权&quot;和&quot;渔民有清洁水权&quot;两种法律安排下，最终污染水平是否相同？什么会不同？</li>\n<li>为什么全球气候变化难以靠科斯式的私人协商解决？这说明科斯定理的适用边界在哪里？</li>\n<li>比较庇古税和可交易排放许可证：在控制污染总量的确定性和成本最小化方面，二者各有什么优势？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Arthur Pigou,《The Economics of Welfare》——庇古税思想的源头</li>\n<li>Ronald Coase, &quot;The Problem of Social Cost&quot;, 1960——科斯定理的奠基论文，被引用最多的经济学论文之一</li>\n<li>William Nordhaus,《气候赌场》——诺奖得主关于碳税与气候政策的通俗著作</li>\n<li>现实连接：查阅中国全国碳排放权交易市场的运行机制，思考它如何给碳排放定价。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>外部性源于私人成本（收益）与社会成本（收益）之间的缺口：负外部性导致过度生产，正外部性导致供给不足，两者都造成无谓损失。庇古的方案是对负外部性征税（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = MSC - MPC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）、对正外部性补贴，把外部影响&quot;内部化&quot;，碳税是其当代典范。科斯定理则提供了另一条思路：只要产权清晰、交易成本低，私人协商也能达到效率，但它的适用范围受交易成本限制。政府的工具箱包括庇古税、数量管制、可交易许可证和产权界定，各有适用场景。至此第一章完成了财政学的理论地基——下一章我们将进入财政的核心实务：税收。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学财政学 — 外部性与矫正性政策","id":"大学财政学-外部性与矫正性政策"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"私人成本、社会成本与无谓损失","id":"私人成本-社会成本与无谓损失"},{"level":3,"text":"庇古税：让污染者付费","id":"庇古税-让污染者付费"},{"level":3,"text":"科斯定理：产权与市场化解决","id":"科斯定理-产权与市场化解决"},{"level":3,"text":"矫正外部性的工具箱","id":"矫正外部性的工具箱"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学财政学 — 公共物品","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/public-finance-foundations/public-goods"},"next":{"title":"大学财政学 — 税收原则与税制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/public-finance/government-revenue/taxation-principles"}}